7
00:00:19,063 --> 00:00:22,875
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

8
00:00:22,875 --> 00:00:26,688
Stay practical: describe delivery path before you optimize branding or tools.

9
00:00:27,008 --> 00:00:31,350
